<contentList>
	<content contentuid="he2544cbfgd0c6g4f52g8d1egf3dde2de6d93" version="1">酸蝕溶皮</content>
	<content contentuid="hebec1d8aga526g41fegb08cgc7f243ad0344" version="1">強酸侵蝕了護甲。&lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;護甲等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;降低&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;點。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd897ff08g5bc5g425cg8cafg6f2dc814f1a3" version="1">苛性鞭撻</content>
	<content contentuid="h12735b96gb271g4d6egbd1egd5844013a477" version="1">以偽足抽擊，造成&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;，並額外造成&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;。已被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;強酸&lt;/LSTag&gt;覆蓋的敵人承受&lt;b&gt;額外&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;[3]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb19a22e1g91beg4f02gbd11g1a9dc833d6e6" version="1">苛性噴吐</content>
	<content contentuid="h4440d39dg5452g4c7cgb2e7g43840ad73bd6" version="1">噴吐強酸，造成&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;，並製造一片&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;強酸&lt;/LSTag&gt;地表。已被其覆蓋的敵人承受&lt;b&gt;額外&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha6221dacgba37g473ag8407g8f948781fb95" version="1">變異強酸衍體</content>
	<content contentuid="h47b87f5cg934bg47d1g80d2g4f4a7b8b4600" version="1">苛性阿米巴原蟲</content>
	<content contentuid="h7e0c87d0g661eg4668gac42g2e121dab8ae4" version="1">鎧裝蛞蝓</content>
