	<content contentuid="hb42d0cd0g555dg491aga5a7g5c9c96a509e2" version="1">強酸育群</content>
	<content contentuid="h04179020g6951g43a6g86f1ge268f4fd7df7" version="1">每場戰鬥中，你首次以&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;強酸&lt;/LSTag&gt;覆蓋一名敵人時，召喚一隻自行戰鬥的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;。當你在強酸之中戰鬥時，它會成長並獲得突變——浸浴於&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;強酸&lt;/LSTag&gt;地表，並殺死被強酸覆蓋的敵人。戰鬥結束時，育群消溶。</content>
	<content contentuid="he0c0fb16gd671g44edga410g23de5975a0f5" version="1">衰朽媒介</content>
	<content contentuid="haa73f210g2ec5g494fg8fdag3d8c63054150" version="1">被你&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;擊中的敵人損失&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;點&lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;護甲等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf8e38740g977bg47d6g9c87g2c03fc34eccc" version="1">溶媒遺傳</content>
	<content contentuid="h5c324e35g630fg4859g9830g26f89074f0f6" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;無視對&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistance"&gt;抗性&lt;/LSTag&gt;。被它們擊中的敵人對&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;具有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;易傷&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hdacb2b73g8076g4168ga43eg9f1b536e298b" version="1">共生匯流</content>
	<content contentuid="ha70e1688ga4b8g4c0fgaaa9gbf20538112a1" version="1">當你被&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;強酸&lt;/LSTag&gt;覆蓋時，你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;每回合也造成&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;，並獲得&lt;b&gt;[2]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h08a49ac7g874ag45b1g812fgfbe741741a6e" version="1">原初培養</content>
	<content contentuid="hf94c4abcg1cacg4a73ga750ga8b562c4ed93" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;站在&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;強酸&lt;/LSTag&gt;中時，於其回合開始時恢復&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6434d003g92d3g42ffgb217g6420a8c36bd3" version="1">定向誘變</content>
	<content contentuid="h60f9beebgd6bfg4199g8a2ag0eb027c71503" version="1">你為你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;挑選它們所獲得的突變。在你與酸液共舞之際——處於&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;強酸&lt;/LSTag&gt;之中，並殺死被強酸覆蓋的敵人，它們將成長為更強韌的形態。</content>
	<content contentuid="h24171af1g3cfcg4e91gae95gf4c3db8e1821" version="1">苛性棘刺</content>
	<content contentuid="h06d97f6ag6b83g4dc5g9a24g70e918cd5ad0" version="1">以近戰攻擊命中你&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;的攻擊者受到&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="he6e63bd2g1a59g42e4g89b3gc27fa0f3967b" version="1">硬甲殼</content>
	<content contentuid="h32dce215g47a9g4a66gab39g4484244696b0" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;獲得&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;護甲等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="haed69e0bg8b8bg4544g92f7g069ba3ed59f1" version="1">肥大增生</content>
	<content contentuid="ha128c563g15ccg44edg8a59g3cfe649df93f" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;獲得&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt;點最大&lt;LSTag Tooltip="HitPoints"&gt;生命值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h3d3595deg9335g43e9gadc0ga4dbdaf1a3df" version="1">偽足</content>
	<content contentuid="hce775732g8b2fg4146gbe91gc5bb4db2d076" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;獲得&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed"&gt;移動速度&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc7621a23g7c8fg4fe3gb1c7g40fcec66cce9" version="1">暴食</content>
	<content contentuid="h90485cf1ge091g4e90gbd06gb78510e49e34" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;的攻擊&lt;b&gt;也&lt;/b&gt;造成&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6d1d70d9gf8c2g4bdegb643gc06ce869d38d" version="1">黏液皮層</content>
	<content contentuid="h5022ef91gc5e5g403fg9d33gdd8c4610ba35" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;從任意來源受到的傷害減少&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6e690424g97a4g4077gb480g8868eafeeedc" version="1">敏銳</content>
	<content contentuid="h014da6dcgdaa5g4566gbcdegc3d50ec5b967" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;獲得&lt;b&gt;+[1]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻擊檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;加值。</content>
	<content contentuid="he658aeb0g6e31g4c4dgba99gb1ee8cd77e3f" version="1">大顎</content>
	<content contentuid="h44d03aabg62c1g476fgaa22g1970f5bdcc83" version="1">使你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_MUTACID_ACIDSPAWN_INFO"&gt;強酸衍體&lt;/LSTag&gt;的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;重擊&lt;/LSTag&gt;觸發閾值降低&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc376c2a8g305bg4c50ga492gb0dc7f07e9fb" version="1">酸蝕攫握</content>
	<content contentuid="he6491ce7g0fc6g4700ga3fbgf77b7a644067" version="1">這隻史萊姆的打擊侵蝕護甲，降低被擊中敵人的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;護甲等級&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h55c413fagcc59g4343gae75g90e3cb8484ea" version="1">溶媒</content>
	<content contentuid="hf9bf73b5gcf1ag4cc0gb6c5g2cc68725f212" version="1">這隻史萊姆的強酸無視對&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;的&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistance"&gt;抗性&lt;/LSTag&gt;，並讓被擊中的敵人變得&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;易傷&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h72c18e5bg26eeg4231g9d00gac3ccb533ac8" version="1">共生</content>
	<content contentuid="h37ad109eg31b2g4833gabf1g5ff7bb8482cb" version="1">浸沒於你的&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;強酸&lt;/LSTag&gt;之中，這隻史萊姆&lt;b&gt;也&lt;/b&gt;造成&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;，並裹上了一層酸液護盾。</content>
	<content contentuid="haa6620eag0a59g4e9cg92c5g32139c5a3d44" version="1">饜足</content>
	<content contentuid="hba417956g2594g4bdbg9390g035ff4965086" version="1">這隻史萊姆在&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="ACID"&gt;強酸&lt;/LSTag&gt;中打滾時會恢復。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8a9c0f1bgf0d4g4fe4gbbdegff4194976f77" version="1">液化</content>
	<content contentuid="h829e5276g272cg4a4eg9cb1g79d7bacbde4c" version="1">血肉變得柔軟。對&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;具有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Vulnerable"&gt;易傷&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
